    "name": "Can a Garage Be Converted Into a Legal Bedroom in San Diego or Chula Vista?",
    "text": "Can a Garage Be Converted Into a Legal Bedroom in San Diego or Chula Vista?",
    "@type": "Question",
    "answerCount": 1,
    "acceptedAnswer": {
      "text": "Yes, but turning a garage into a legal bedroom usually requires more than adding drywall and flooring. The project may involve permits, insulation, weatherproofing, heating and ventilation, electrical changes, an emergency escape opening, and parking review. In the City of San Diego, official guidance specifically addresses residential garage conversions and replacement parking when required parking is removed.",
